# Session 7: 1813, one player, the Allies (the shipped NWS.CFG), Tactical off.
# The scenario's start: its objective, end conditions and forces, then three turns
# (docs\won-source-study.md, section 3.2). Sessions 4, 5 and 8 play their scenarios to
# the end; this one stops after three turns.
seed 1
pace 1

wait 4
key space
wait 4
key s
wait 2
key down down down down down
wait 1
shot start-year
key enter
wait 3
shot objective
key space
wait 1
key u t esc
wait 1
shot main-menu
key u e
wait 1
shot end-cond
key esc
wait 1
key esc
wait 1
key i down down down enter
wait 1
shot force-summary
key space
wait 1
key i down enter
wait 1
shot allied-armies
key space
wait 1

# Each turn: end it, wait for the computer's moves, then Esc to close the messages.
# Esc also answers a retreat menu (the game then chooses the retreat itself) and matches
# no item of the main menu.
repeat 3
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key esc
wait 2
end
shot next-turn
end
